    "result_text": "The only remaining references are in the acceptance test itself, where they're intentional \u2014 the test asserts those old fields are *gone*. That passes.\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>` and removed the standalone `checkDigit`. All tests pass (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 4/4).\n\n**What changed and where each piece of logic lives:**\n\n- **`MemberIdGenerator`** (new, replaces `CustomerCodeGenerator`) \u2014 owns the member-id format. `generate(region, registrationDate, telephone, lastName)` builds `<REGION>` + 2-digit FY (via `FiscalYearResolver`) + 8-hex `HASH8` (via `Sha256Hex`, same digest as the region-and-hash identity) + Luhn `CHK` (via `LuhnCheckDigit`) computed over the `<REGION><FY><HASH8>` body. It also owns parsing: `regionOf` and `fiscalYearOf` strip any collision suffix and slice the fixed trailing segments. `deduplicate` (unchanged logic) now applies to the full member id.\n- **`MembershipNumberFormatter`** \u2014 deleted (its role is now subsumed by the member id).\n- **`Owner`** \u2014 field/column `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`; `primaryIdentifier()` returns the member id.\n- **Controller** \u2014 `assignMemberId` passes the registration date through so the FY segment is embedded; collision handling reads the member id.\n- **`OwnerMapper`** \u2014 dropped `checkDigit`/`membershipNumber`; `memberId` maps implicitly; `fiscalYear` and `locality` now derive from the member id's embedded segments (per the spec's \"reference the memberId\").\n- **Audit** \u2014 `OwnerAuditLogger` line and `OwnerCreatedEvent` record field now use `memberId`.\n- **Persistence** \u2014 `ClinicService`, `OwnerRepository`, and all three impls renamed to `findByMemberIdStartingWith`; all four DB schemas renamed the column to `member_id`.\n- **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 the three fields collapsed into one `memberId` schema; `locality` description updated.\n\nThe audit log confirms the shape end-to-end: `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (NSW + FY `27` + HASH8 `16E6609E` + CHK `1`).\n\nEach responsibility stayed in its own small unit \u2014 format/parse in `MemberIdGenerator`, date\u2192FY in `FiscalYearResolver`, Luhn in `LuhnCheckDigit`, hashing in `Sha256Hex` \u2014 with no logic copied between them.",
